      "## Why app updates matter",
      "An app update is not only about getting a new interface or feature. Google Play Help notes that updating Android apps gives users access to newer features and can improve security and stability. Android Authority likewise recommends keeping apps current because updates can include bug fixes and security patches.",
      "That makes app maintenance a simple habit worth keeping, especially for apps you use for communication, payments, work or personal information.",
      "## How to update apps manually",
      "Open the Google Play Store and tap your profile picture. Choose **Manage apps & device**, then look for the available updates section. You can review the list and update a single app or use the option to update all available apps.",
